if ptT(1,$64)<=5 then
call CreateUnitAtLoc(Vy,$65304849,SFF,TgF)
call OeT(gg[GetPlayerId(GetOwningPlayer(IFF))],CFF,200000.,1.,1.,ATTACK_TYPE_NORMAL,DAMAGE_TYPE_UNIVERSAL)
call Ymy(gg[GetPlayerId(GetOwningPlayer(IFF))],.0,550.,bgF,300000.,1.,1.,ATTACK_TYPE_NORMAL,DAMAGE_TYPE_UNIVERSAL)
set bj_lastPlayedSound=tyy("SE\\halfmoon.wav",null,$7f,1.,false,1000.,1500.)
call StopSound(bj_lastPlayedSound,false,false)
call lHT(IFF,bj_lastPlayedSound)
endif
call RemoveLocation(SFF)
call RemoveLocation(bgF)
set IFF=null
set CFF=null
set SFF=null
set bgF=null
endfunction
function ykb takes nothing returns nothing
local integer Yob=GetPlayerId(GetTriggerPlayer())
local player Iob=Player(Yob)
local real Uob=GetStartLocationX(GetPlayerStartLocation(Iob))
local real Eob
local integer lob
local unit Cob
local player Sob
local player bkb
local player Tkb
set Iob=Player(Yob)
set Eob=GetStartLocationY(GetPlayerStartLocation(Iob))
set lob=50
set Cob=GetTrainedUnit()
call ShowUnit(Cob,false)
call KillUnit(Cob)
set mF[Yob]=mF[Yob]+1
if ptT(1,$64)<=30 then
call DisplayTimedTextToForce(bj_FORCE_ALL_PLAYERS,5.,GetPlayerName(Player(Yob))+"|r 님이 |cffff8200고급유닛 도박|r을 |cffff0000실패|r 하셨습니다.")
set bj_lastCreatedUnit=CreateUnit(Player(Yob),$68303647,Uob,Eob,bj_UNIT_FACING)
call DisplayTimedTextToPlayer(Player(Yob),0.,0.,5.,"|cffffdead◈|r |cffff8200고급유닛 도박|r을 실패하여 "+GetUnitName(bj_lastCreatedUnit)+" 1개 획득")
set VF[Yob]=VF[Yob]+1
if Og[Yob]==2 then
set bj_lastCreatedUnit=CreateUnit(Player(Yob),$68303647,Uob,Eob,bj_UNIT_FACING)
call SetPlayerState(Player(Yob),PLAYER_STATE_RESOURCE_LUMBER,GetPlayerState(Player(Yob),PLAYER_STATE_RESOURCE_LUMBER)+1)
call DisplayTimedTextToPlayer(Player(Yob),0.,0.,5.,"|cffF15F5F[시스템]|r |cffffae00도박광 :: 리스크헷지|r 항법효과로 |cff7ad823목재 1개|r, "+GetUnitName(bj_lastCreatedUnit)+" 1개 추가 획득")
endif
set Sob=Player(Yob)
set Q=Sob
call TriggerEvaluate(r)
set Iob=null
set Cob=null
set Sob=null
set bkb=null
set Tkb=null
return
endif
if Og[Yob]!=1 and ptT(1,$64)<=4 then
set eF[Yob]=eF[Yob]+1
set bj_lastCreatedUnit=CreateUnit(Player(Yob),$68303558,Uob,Eob,bj_UNIT_FACING)
call DisplayTimedTextToForce(bj_FORCE_ALL_PLAYERS,5.,GetPlayerName(Player(Yob))+"|r 님이 |cffff8200고급유닛 도박|r으로 "+GetUnitName(bj_lastCreatedUnit)+" 획득!")
set bkb=Player(Yob)
set Q=bkb
call TriggerEvaluate(r)
set Iob=null
set Cob=null
set Sob=null
set bkb=null
set Tkb=null
return
endif
if Og[Yob]==1 then
set lob=0
endif
if ptT(1,$64)<=lob then
set DF[Yob]=DF[Yob]+1
set bj_lastCreatedUnit=PlaceRandomUnit(bq,Player(Yob),Uob,Eob,bj_UNIT_FACING)
call IssueImmediateOrder(bj_lastCreatedUnit,"holdposition")
call DisplayTimedTextToForce(bj_FORCE_ALL_PLAYERS,5.,GetPlayerName(Player(Yob))+"|r 님이 |cffff8200고급유닛 도박|r으로 "+GetUnitName(bj_lastCreatedUnit)+" 획득!")
else
set eF[Yob]=eF[Yob]+1
set bj_lastCreatedUnit=PlaceRandomUnit(Tq,Player(Yob),Uob,Eob,bj_UNIT_FACING)
call UnitAddAbility(bj_lastCreatedUnit,$41305945)
call IssueImmediateOrder(bj_lastCreatedUnit,"holdposition")
call DisplayTimedTextToForce(bj_FORCE_ALL_PLAYERS,5.,GetPlayerName(Player(Yob))+"|r 님이 |cffff8200고급유닛 도박|r으로 "+GetUnitName(bj_lastCreatedUnit)+" 획득!")
endif
set Tkb=Player(Yob)
set Q=Tkb
call TriggerEvaluate(r)
set Iob=null
set Cob=null
set Sob=null
set bkb=null
set Tkb=null
endfunction
